  "description": {
    "en": "Wilson Synthetic Gut Power 17 is a solid-core nylon string featuring high-energy wraps that deliver crisp feel, responsive power and dependable control. The thinner 17 gauge (1.25 mm) increases feel and touch compared with the 16 gauge while remaining arm-friendly and easy to play.",

    "zh": "Wilson Synthetic Gut Power 17 是一款采用 Solid Core Nylon（实心尼龙）结构的合成肠线，配备 High Energy Wraps 外层包覆，可提供清晰的击球反馈、轻松的力量输出以及稳定的控制。相比 16 号径，17（1.25mm）拥有更好的手感、触球反馈和控制能力，同时保持舒适、易打和对手臂友好的特点。"
  },

